### READ ALL CHARACTERS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/characters

### READ ONE CHARACTER (replace ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/characters/1

### UPDATE CHARACTER (replace ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/characters/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "UPDATED NAME",
  "description": "UPDATED DESCRIPTION",
  "universe": "One Piece",
  "role": "UPDATED ROLE",
  "firstAppearance": "1997-07-22"
}

